  m_text: "Xin ch\xE0o, Ch\xFAng t\xF4i r\u1EA5t vui khi b\u1EA1n \u0111\u1EBFn v\u1EDBi
    Ph\xF2ng Tranh S\u1ED1 B\u1EA3o V\u1EADt Qu\u1ED1c Gia. B\u1EA1n c\xF3 th\u1EC3
    kh\xE1m ph\xE1 kh\xF4ng gian \u1EA3o n\xE0y ngay tr\xEAn m\xE1y t\xEDnh c\u1EE7a
    m\xECnh ho\u1EB7c \u0111\u1EAFm ch\xECm tr\u1ECDn v\u1EB9n h\u01A1n b\u1EB1ng
    k\xEDnh th\u1EF1c t\u1EBF \u1EA3o h\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3 WebXR.\r\n\r\n\u0110\u1EC3
    b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u h\xE0nh tr\xECnh VR, h\xE3y m\u1EDF tr\xEAn tr\xECnh duy\u1EC7t
    c\u1EE7a k\xEDnh th\u1EF1c t\u1EBF \u1EA3o v\xE0 l\xE0m theo h\u01B0\u1EDBng
    d\u1EABn hi\u1EC3n th\u1ECB."
